# Adapted from EYE reasoning examples (MIT, Jos De Roo).
# Source: https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/rdf-star-reasoning/
# Standalone program; EYE answer directives use log:query.

# Source file: rdf-star-reasoning/socrates.n3
@base <https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/rdf-star-reasoning/socrates.n3>.
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix : <http://example.org/socrates#>.

:we :have <<( :Socrates rdf:type :Human )>>.
:Human rdfs:subClassOf :Mortal.

{?A rdfs:subClassOf ?B. :we :have <<( ?S rdf:type ?A )>>} => {:we :have <<( ?S rdf:type ?B )>>}.

